6e2ca3aec687fecfcfd3b8d70476195e.webm?t=1564073964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909970/extras/6e2ca3aec687fecfcfd3b8d70476195e.mp4?t=1564073964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Produce, Release, Repeat:</h2> Keep a tight watch on inventory, making sure you have the parts you need, without too much inventory sitting around!. Careful project management ensures that products are released and marketed in a timely manner to meet consumer needs \u2014 but keep an eye out for poor sales, and be ready to respond!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909970/extras/649be0e882245356419fcb1045e992d1.poster.avif?t=1564073964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909970/extras/649be0e882245356419fcb1045e992d1.webm?t=1564073964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909970/extras/649be0e882245356419fcb1045e992d1.mp4?t=1564073964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Home Sweet Office: </h2>Customize everything in your office from window placement to how close your employees sit to one another. Don\u2019t forget to add a foosball table and television for break time!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909970/extras/89019e87cb3a2cd53af5cd1680848128.poster.avif?t=1564073964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909970/extras/89019e87cb3a2cd53af5cd1680848128.webm?t=1564073964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909970/extras/89019e87cb3a2cd53af5cd1680848128.